  "required_order_and_branches": [
    "NetCDF classic creation; dimensions, variables, attributes, fill settings, enddef and coordinates in exact source order",
    "Source-size explicit counts for all slabs/parameter data; no default C full-variable shape guessing",
    "Time/time_bnds before registry variables; source sample counts/averaging, grid-specific writes and last status semantics retained",
    "Grid type/size early returns and Native allocation/update order retained; no invented stats_grid_init validation",
    "SILHS init including zero-name lists, coordinate reuse/redefine and individual output failure checks",
    "All registry template arms, hydrometeor pair loops, scalar/category counts, deduplication/truncation and fixed names",
    "Legacy3/4pipe fields, grid aliases and unknown-grid defaultZT; comment predicate examines firstcharacter only",
    "Date fixed fields/Native NINT, MOD/int divisions, calendar and trailingblank behavior"
  ],
  "approved_adaptations": [
    "Native SAVE l_warned_overflow becomes caller-owned stats_type bool retained for context lifetime; passed explicitly through expand/add. Warning-only multiplicity change, no math/order/truncation change.",
    "Absent optional scalar dimensions stay absent through private call; an active scalar-template requiring an absent dimension is rejected rather than invoking Native absent-required-dummy undefined behavior.",
    "Empty/comment-only registry Native unallocated defs reaches unconditional DEALLOCATE; keep explicit fatal boundary rather than silently creating enabled empty stats.",
    "Vectors represent fixed registry slots, strings retain Native truncation and rightblank rules; NetCDF parameter name width preserves old pack_strings=max(1,allstringlengths) contract."
  ],
